==Trivia==
*The illustration rare print of this card features {{p|Uxie}}, {{p|Mesprit}}, and {{p|Azelf}} at [[Lake Verity]]. Verity Cavern can be seen in the background; Mesprit can be found here in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{game|Platinum||Platinum}}, {{pkmn|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|Brilliant Diamond, Shining Pearl}}, and {{pkmn|Legends: Arceus}}.

===Origin===
*'''Supreme Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Legends Awakened|Mesprit LV.X|143}} from the {{TCG|Legends Awakened}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

